i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">提高输出和辅助能力，很好的契合了角色的技能机制。</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/11/07/50494840/54385f9c708c261352ca8823072f43f8_4735166059512848329.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>空梦 · 掠集之兽</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">可为全队提供无条件的全伤加成。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/11/07/50494840/06a013456bea48e88a40dde02e8850ef_5053414232231487762.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">能够无条件提升全队的全伤害，具有一定的辅助能力；武器技命中敌人时，造成范围火伤同时提高自身的全伤害。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">时帆旅人使用时，【Aimer-γ切割者】/【Aimer-Λ领域】可多次触发武器的技能效果，追加额外的攻击和连击手段；蓄力攻击并且击回环刃后将提高自身对点燃敌人造成的火伤。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2022/11/07/50494840/06a013456bea48e88a40dde02e8850ef_5053414232231487762.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></d